monaco.img — Self-built Monaco IMG fixture
==========================================

Built from OpenStreetMap data via mkgmap.

Map data
--------
Source: OpenStreetMap contributors.
Licence: Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.
Full text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Attribution: © OpenStreetMap contributors.

Redistribution within this repository is permitted under ODbL provided the
attribution above is preserved. The file is included here solely as a small,
deterministic test fixture for the `kmp-garmin-img` parser; it is not
redistributed for end-user mapping use.

Build chain
-----------
mkgmap (https://www.mkgmap.org.uk/) is licensed under the LGPL-3.0; that
licence applies to mkgmap itself, not to the IMG output produced by it.
